{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>25歲前女子組合SPIRAL成員靜靜（Marvia）曾因亮相節目被封為靚版王菀之，今年突然宣布離隊轉型專注個人發展。最近她不僅推出首本個人實體寫真集，更在社交平台大派惹火性感福利。她罕有換上金髮造型配搭吸睛泳裝，嶄新形象徹底顛覆過往清純氣質。（...</p>\n<p>25歲前女子組合SPIRAL成員靜靜（Marvia）曾因亮相節目被封為靚版王菀之，今年突然宣布離隊轉型專注個人發展。最近她不僅推出首本個人實體寫真集，更在社交平台大派惹火性感福利。她罕有換上金髮造型配搭吸睛泳裝，嶄新形象徹底顛覆過往清純氣質。\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488868900093273_10574598556afbd3f1e0f93.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"chingching__marvia_1792666941_4013503015214159261_5629372763.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488868900093273_10574598556afbd3f1e0f93.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：chingching__marvia）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488869334651835_6282732576afbd3f65461d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"chingching__marvia_1793802884_4023032373272536585_5629372763.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488869334651835_6282732576afbd3f65461d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：chingching__marvia）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>靜靜Marvia金髮配黃色泳裝煥然一新</h2>\n<p>靜靜（Marvia）曾經以斯文清純形象示人並曾參演電影《查無此人》采兒一角，靜靜近期在社交平台大膽挑戰全新破格風格。她將一頭黑髮漂染成搶眼金髮，更特意穿上一套鮮黃色性感泳裝在鏡頭前擺出多個誘人姿勢拍攝照片。她在貼文中以英文留言表示黃色是今年幸運色」（Wearing the Luckiest colour of this year）， 全新造型不但突顯出她白滑肌膚，更將她姣好身段表露無遺，與昔日跳芭蕾舞時乖巧模樣形成極大反差。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488870161548509_14182395186afbd3febb834.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"chingching__marvia_1792396252_4011232353447829185_5629372763.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488870161548509_14182395186afbd3febb834.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：chingching__marvia）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488870654132071_21280307986afbd40355f95.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"chingching__marvia_1792396252_4011232324289011939_5629372763.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488870654132071_21280307986afbd40355f95.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：chingching__marvia）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>告別女團後推出《只想靜靜》</h2>\n<p>2001年1月出世嘅「靜靜」於2023年10月加入女子組合SPIRAL出道，但短短不足一年便於2024年7月正式離隊。恢復自由身後她積極開拓網絡創作者及模特兒事業，早前趁書展期間推出首本個人寫真集《只想靜靜》，更特別發售附送唇印卡極上套裝。為了回饋一直支持她粉絲，她於11月親自籌辦見面會，選址機場富豪機場酒店與支持者進行近距離互動。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488871539534496_11981229476afbd40bbfdb6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"chingching__marvia_1794035478_4024982199749012510_5629372763.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488871539534496_11981229476afbd40bbfdb6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：chingching__marvia）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>亮相《戀講嘢》自爆易戀上拍檔</h2>\n<p>回顧靜靜過往最具話題性電視演出，必然是獲邀擔任ViuTV探討感情觀節目《戀講嘢》嘉賓。當時她毫無保留地分享自己多情性格，直認每次與男伴合作跳芭蕾舞或演戲時，只要有身體接觸或眼神交投便會心跳加速並愛上對方。她更在節目中公開向主持193示愛，坦言非常欣賞對方獨特氣場，又大方承認自己特別鍾情某種男性專屬汗味，坦率大膽言論令現場主持郭奕芯等人大感嘩然。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488872684169986_18505599776afbd417877e6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"靜靜寫真集 香港小姐 Marvia以一身斯文Look上《戀講嘢》做嘉賓。（圖片來源：《戀講嘢》截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488872684169986_18505599776afbd417877e6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>前香港小姐 Marvia曾經以一身斯文Look上《戀講嘢》做嘉賓。（圖片來源：《戀講嘢》截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民狂讚嶄新氣質似足王菀之</h2>\n<p>自從靜靜公開全新金髮泳裝造型後，各大社交平台立刻湧現大量網民熱烈討論。不少一路關注她動向粉絲留言表示「身材原來咁好」及「金髮真係好襯你」，認為新形象成功擺脫過往枷鎖。同時有一大批網民仍然對她當年選美及上節目模樣印象深刻，直指她不笑時神態依然保留住獨特氣質，紛紛留言稱呼她為「真係幾似Ivana」及「靚女版王菀之」，更有留言指她某個角度撞樣另一男藝人顧定軒。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488871033211397_17752281956afbd40718315.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"chingching__marvia_1792396252_4011232407772400400_5629372763.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179488871033211397_17752281956afbd40718315.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：chingching__marvia）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T04:28:07.731582+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1464,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T04:12:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T04:41:52.485411+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T04:21:41.977322+00:00","content_hash":"9df89414c68a8fac58a34825085a232349c2a1bb5783738eac97ea4af2dce211","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}